findings.suggestion:
设置读取上限并分块写入，例如限制总字节数（如 10MB），超限即中断并返回 413：
MAX = 10 * 1024 * 1024
chunks, size = [], 0
while True:
    chunk = stream.read(64 * 1024)
    if not chunk:
        break
    size += len(chunk)
    if size > MAX:
        raise ValueError("upload too large")
    chunks.append(chunk)
return b"".join(chunks)

